# Frontend stack

- Use Svelte for the frontend of the app
- Use Skeleton and Tailwind CSS for components and design
- Ensure the app functions as a PWA on iOS, including offline support via service workers and a manifest that allows adding the app to the home screen.
- Do not hardcode any addresses, use variables instead and put them in the [client.env](mdc:client/client.env) file
